auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  # Etiqueta ZPL API

  Bruno collection for the Zebra Label Designer backend.

  ## Setup
  1. Start the backend: `npm run dev:backend` (listens on `http://localhost:3001`).
  2. Select the **Local** environment (top-right in Bruno).
  3. Run **Auth / Register** once (safe to re-run — 409 if the user exists), then
     **Auth / Login**. Login saves the JWT into the `token` collection variable,
     which every protected request reads via `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.
  4. Run **Designs / Create Design** to populate the `designId` variable for the
     other design requests.

  The JWT expires after 60 minutes — re-run Login if requests start returning 401.
}
